---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import MedicalDisclaimer from '../components/MedicalDisclaimer.astro';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead 
			title="Our Mission: The Human Glue Between Patients & Doctors | Decoding The Burn" 
			description="Bridging the communication and diagnostic gap between Burning Mouth Syndrome sufferers, dentists, physicians, and clinical researchers." 
		/>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main class="mission-page-container">
			<div class="disclaimer-wrap">
				<MedicalDisclaimer />
			</div>

			<!-- Hero Header -->
			<header class="mission-hero">
				<h1 class="mission-title">The Human Glue: Bridging Patients &amp; Doctors</h1>
				<p class="mission-subtitle">
					Why we are connecting lived patient time-series data with clinical neuroscience to solve Burning Mouth Syndrome once and for&nbsp;all.
				</p>
			</header>

			<!-- 1. The Core Problem: The Communication Chasm -->
			<section class="mission-section">
				<div class="problem-card">
					<h2 class="section-title">The Communication Chasm in Modern Medicine</h2>
					<p class="section-lead">
						When you walk into a specialist clinic with severe 10/10 oral burning, your life is in crisis. Every meal is a battle with fire, and you cannot sleep. But for the busy clinician seeing dozens of complex patients a day, they must maintain emotional detachment to manage clinical volume. As a result, acute patient agony often gets translated into standardized, sanitized medical&nbsp;jargon:
					</p>
					<div class="quote-contrast-grid">
						<div class="contrast-box patient-side">
							<span class="box-tag tag-red">What the Patient Experiences</span>
							<p class="quote-text">"My mouth is on fire 24/7. When I drink coffee or eat an orange, the burning shoots to a blinding 10/10. I can't concentrate on my job or sleep at night."</p>
						</div>
						<div class="contrast-box chart-side">
							<span class="box-tag tag-blue">What Gets Written in the Chart</span>
							<p class="quote-text">"Oral mucosa appears unremarkable. Mild-to-moderate neuropathic discomfort (3–5/10) with anxious overlay. Etiology idiopathic. Reassure patient."</p>
						</div>
					</div>
					<p class="section-foot">
						When patients request their medical records and see their 10/10 agony reduced to a <em>"mild 3/10 with anxiety"</em>, they choke. They feel gaslighted, insulted, and abandoned. Many give up entirely. This is where the podcast steps&nbsp;in.
					</p>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- 2. The Human Glue Diagram & Architecture -->
			<section class="mission-section">
				<h2 class="section-title text-center">How The Podcast Acts as the Human Glue</h2>
				<p class="section-lead text-center">
					We don't assign blame or attack doctors. We translate the two worlds so both sides can collaborate on real biological&nbsp;solutions.
				</p>

				<div class="glue-diagram-container">
					<div class="diagram-hub">
						<span class="hub-label">THE PODCAST &amp; RESEARCH HUB</span>
						<h3 class="hub-title">Decoding The Burn &bull; The BMS Podcast</h3>
						<p class="hub-motto">"The Rosetta Stone Between Lived Agony &amp; Clinical Science"</p>
					</div>

					<div class="diagram-branches">
						<!-- Branch 1: For Patients -->
						<div class="branch-card branch-patient">
							<div class="branch-header">
								<span class="branch-icon" aria-hidden="true">🛡️</span>
								<h4 class="branch-title">For Patients &amp; Sufferers</h4>
							</div>
							<ul class="branch-list">
								<li><strong>Decodes Medical Jargon:</strong> Explains why doctors write "3/10" or "anxious" so patients don't panic, take it personally, or despair.</li>
								<li><strong>Biophysical Validation:</strong> Demonstrates that your burning has physical ion-channel and hardware mechanisms, not "imagined stress."</li>
								<li><strong>Constructive Communication:</strong> Teaches patients how to speak with dentists and doctors with clear, structured time-series logs.</li>
							</ul>
						</div>

						<!-- Branch 2: For Clinicians -->
						<div class="branch-card branch-clinician">
							<div class="branch-header">
								<span class="branch-icon" aria-hidden="true">🩺</span>
								<h4 class="branch-title">For Clinicians &amp; Researchers</h4>
							</div>
							<ul class="branch-list">
								<li><strong>The High-Functioning 10/10:</strong> Explains why stoic, articulate patients are still in excruciating pain despite not screaming in the chair.</li>
								<li><strong>Hardware &amp; Acid Mechanics:</strong> Shares high-resolution data on subgingival crown leaks, exposed dentin tubules, and dietary acid triggers.</li>
								<li><strong>Beyond "Luck" &amp; Placebo:</strong> Proves that dietary elimination remission is reproducible biophysics and biochemistry, not a fluke.</li>
							</ul>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- 3. Our Three Core Pillars -->
			<section class="mission-section">
				<h2 class="section-title">The Three Pillars of Our Mission</h2>
				<div class="pillars-grid">
					<div class="pillar-card">
						<span class="pillar-num">01</span>
						<h3 class="pillar-heading">Radical Data Transparency</h3>
						<p class="pillar-desc">
							We share every radiograph, symptom log, dietary protocol, and dental invoice publicly. By putting real N=1 data in the open, we eliminate guesswork and give researchers a tangible baseline to study.
						</p>
					</div>

					<div class="pillar-card">
						<span class="pillar-num">02</span>
						<h3 class="pillar-heading">Root-Cause Engineering</h3>
						<p class="pillar-desc">
							We treat the human mouth like a high-precision electrical and biochemical system. When a nerve fires distress, we don't just sedate the brain with pharmaceuticals; we track down the physical trigger causing the leak.
						</p>
					</div>

					<div class="pillar-card">
						<span class="pillar-num">03</span>
						<h3 class="pillar-heading">Collaborative Problem-Solving</h3>
						<p class="pillar-desc">
							We invite dentists, oral medicine specialists, neurologists, and academic researchers to brainstorm openly on air without the fear of needing perfect textbook answers. Real discoveries happen through open dialogue.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- CTA Box -->
			<section class="mission-cta-box">
				<h2 class="cta-title">Be Part of the Solution</h2>
				<p class="cta-subtitle">
					Whether you are enduring BMS, practicing dentistry, or researching neuropathic pain, your voice and data can help solve this puzzle for millions.
				</p>
				<div class="cta-actions">
					<a href="/podcast#apply" class="btn btn-primary cta-btn">Apply to Be a Guest &rarr;</a>
					<a href="/blog/how-i-solved-my-burning-mouth-syndrome/" class="btn btn-outline cta-btn">Read Post #1: My Journey</a>
				</div>
			</section>
		</main>
		<Footer />

		<style>
			.mission-page-container {
				max-width: 920px;
				margin: 0 auto;
				padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem 6rem 1.5rem;
			}

			.disclaimer-wrap {
				margin-bottom: 2rem;
			}

			.mission-hero {
				text-align: center;
				margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
			}

			.mission-title {
				font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 4.5vw, 3.2rem);
				font-weight: 800;
				color: #0f172a;
				letter-spacing: -0.025em;
				line-height: 1.15;
				margin: 0 auto 1.25rem auto;
				text-wrap: balance;
			}

			.mission-subtitle {
				font-size: 1.2rem;
				line-height: 1.6;
				color: #334155;
				max-width: 760px;
				margin: 0 auto;
				text-wrap: balance;
			}

			.mission-section {
				margin-bottom: 4rem;
			}

			.section-title {
				font-size: 1.85rem;
				font-weight: 800;
				color: #0f172a;
				margin: 0 0 1.25rem 0;
				letter-spacing: -0.02em;
			}

			.section-lead {
				font-size: 1.08rem;
				line-height: 1.68;
				color: #334155;
				margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
				text-wrap: pretty;
			}

			.text-center {
				text-align: center;
			}

			.problem-card {
				background: #ffffff;
				border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
				border-radius: 20px;
				padding: 2.5rem;
				box-shadow: 0 4px 20px -4px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05);
			}

			.quote-contrast-grid {
				display: grid;
				grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
				gap: 1.5rem;
				margin: 2rem 0;
			}

			.contrast-box {
				border-radius: 14px;
				padding: 1.75rem;
				display: flex;
				flex-direction: column;
			}

			.patient-side {
				background: #fff1f2;
				border: 1px solid #fecdd3;
			}

			.chart-side {
				background: #eff6ff;
				border: 1px solid #bfdbfe;
			}

			.box-tag {
				align-self: flex-start;
				font-family: ui-monospace, monospace;
				font-size: 0.75rem;
				font-weight: 800;
				padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
				border-radius: 6px;
				text-transform: uppercase;
				letter-spacing: 0.04em;
				margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
			}

			.tag-red {
				background: #ffe4e6;
				color: #be123c;
			}

			.tag-blue {
				background: #dbeafe;
				color: #1d4ed8;
			}

			.quote-text {
				font-size: 1rem;
				line-height: 1.6;
				color: #1e293b;
				font-style: italic;
				margin: 0;
			}

			.section-foot {
				font-size: 1.02rem;
				line-height: 1.65;
				color: #475569;
				margin: 0;
				text-wrap: pretty;
			}

			/* Glue Diagram Styling */
			.glue-diagram-container {
				background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 0%, #f8fafc 100%);
				border: 2px solid #e2e8f0;
				border-radius: 24px;
				padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
				margin-top: 2rem;
				box-shadow: 0 10px 30px -5px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.06);
			}

			.diagram-hub {
				background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #1e1b4b 100%);
				border-radius: 16px;
				padding: 2rem;
				text-align: center;
				color: #ffffff;
				margin-bottom: 2rem;
				box-shadow: 0 8px 24px -4px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.25);
			}

			.hub-label {
				display: block;
				font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;
				font-size: 0.82rem;
				font-weight: 800;
				color: #c084fc;
				letter-spacing: 0.12em;
				margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
			}

			.hub-title {
				font-size: 1.65rem;
				font-weight: 800;
				color: #ffffff;
				margin: 0 0 0.4rem 0;
			}

			.hub-motto {
				font-size: 1rem;
				color: #cbd5e1;
				font-style: italic;
				margin: 0;
			}

			.diagram-branches {
				display: grid;
				grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
				gap: 1.75rem;
			}

			.branch-card {
				background: #ffffff;
				border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
				border-radius: 16px;
				padding: 2rem;
				box-shadow: 0 4px 14px -3px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);
			}

			.branch-header {
				display: flex;
				align-items: center;
				gap: 0.75rem;
				margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
				padding-bottom: 0.85rem;
				border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
			}

			.branch-icon {
				font-size: 1.6rem;
			}

			.branch-title {
				font-size: 1.25rem;
				font-weight: 800;
				color: #0f172a;
				margin: 0;
			}

			.branch-list {
				margin: 0;
				padding-left: 1.25rem;
				font-size: 0.95rem;
				line-height: 1.65;
				color: #334155;
			}

			.branch-list li {
				margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
			}

			.branch-list li:last-child {
				margin-bottom: 0;
			}

			.branch-list strong {
				color: #0f172a;
			}

			/* Pillars */
			.pillars-grid {
				display: grid;
				grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
				gap: 1.5rem;
			}

			.pillar-card {
				background: #ffffff;
				border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
				border-radius: 16px;
				padding: 2rem 1.75rem;
				box-shadow: 0 4px 16px -4px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);
			}

			.pillar-num {
				font-family: ui-monospace, monospace;
				font-size: 1.6rem;
				font-weight: 900;
				color: #7c3aed;
				display: block;
				margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
			}

			.pillar-heading {
				font-size: 1.22rem;
				font-weight: 800;
				color: #0f172a;
				margin: 0 0 0.65rem 0;
			}

			.pillar-desc {
				font-size: 0.95rem;
				line-height: 1.6;
				color: #475569;
				margin: 0;
				text-wrap: pretty;
			}

			/* CTA */
			.mission-cta-box {
				background: linear-gradient(135deg, #090d16 0%, #15102a 100%);
				border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.3);
				border-radius: 20px;
				padding: 2.75rem 2rem;
				text-align: center;
				margin-top: 3.5rem;
				color: #ffffff;
				box-shadow: 0 16px 40px -8px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.35);
			}

			.mission-cta-box .cta-title {
				font-size: 1.75rem;
				font-weight: 800;
				color: #ffffff;
				margin: 0 0 0.65rem 0;
			}

			.mission-cta-box .cta-subtitle {
				font-size: 1.05rem;
				line-height: 1.6;
				color: #cbd5e1;
				max-width: 640px;
				margin: 0 auto 1.75rem auto;
				text-wrap: balance;
			}

			.cta-actions {
				display: flex;
				justify-content: center;
				gap: 1rem;
				flex-wrap: wrap;
			}

			.cta-btn {
				padding: 0.8rem 1.75rem;
				font-weight: 700;
				text-decoration: none;
			}
		</style>
	</body>
</html>
